WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.940
Berzelius ran the most respected laboratory in Europe out of a converted apartment

2
00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:16.220
kitchen in Stockholm, determining the atomic weights of 45 of the 50 known elements

3
00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.620
to within a few percent of today's values.

4
00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:25.113
When young Wöhler raced through his first assigned analysis, Berzelius handed down

5
00:00:25.113 --> 00:00:29.473
the verdict that trailed him for life: speed without care counts for nothing.

6
00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:36.673
He had drawn the firmest line of the age organic versus inorganic, two kingdoms

7
00:00:36.673 --> 00:00:39.813
under separate laws and his whole system rested on it.
